</div></details>
<div class="research-review-output"><h3 class="t-title-m">What you leave with</h3><dl class="research-output-list t-body-m"><div><dt>A recommendation</dt><dd>Proceed to engineering, revise, or gather missing evidence.</dd></div><div><dt>A reason</dt><dd>What was checked, what is unresolved and what remains untested.</dd></div><div><dt>A next action</dt><dd>Someone accountable for a defined task and resource limit.</dd></div></dl><p class="t-body-s">The owner authorizes engineering separately; deployment requires separate evaluation.</p></div>
</div></section>


